-- ===========================================================================
--  DK_CP1: dual permeability waterflood, oil-water, METRIC.
--
--  DIMENS 5 5 4 holds two continua on the same 5x5x2 geometry:
--    K = 1-2   matrix cells   (porosity 0.20, permeability 1 mD)
--    K = 3-4   fracture cells (porosity 0.01, permeability 500 mD)
--  Fracture cell (I,J,K+2) is the twin of matrix cell (I,J,K).
--
--  Wells connect to the fracture cells only. Water injected at (1,1) moves
--  through the fractures to the producer at (5,5). The matrix has a
--  capillary pressure curve (SATNUM 1), so water imbibes from the fractures
--  into the matrix and pushes oil out. SIGMA sets the matrix-fracture
--  transfer. With DUALPERM the matrix cells also flow to each other.
-- ===========================================================================
RUNSPEC
TITLE
  DK_CP1 dual permeability waterflood (5x5x2 matrix + 5x5x2 fracture)
OIL
WATER
METRIC
UNIFOUT
DIMENS
 5 5 4 /
